.eve/
# wxt's generated types and tsconfig (apps/extension), written by `wxt prepare`
.wxt/

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
*.p8
# the publishing material: the notarization key and ids (apps/desktop/README.md § Packaging)
.release/

